<span id="A2.T5.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Describe the graph of the function <math id="A2.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f:f(x,y)=10-\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f:f(x,y)=10-\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
